                                                "sense_id": "02dd9719-a7ea-3e46-9015-d35883193943",
                                                "text": "Zimra, then, takes an unequivocal stance; favoring Rashi's view over that of Maimonides, he offers little comfort for the rodef approach, holding instead that feticide cannot be regarded as murder becaue the fetus is not a nefesh."
